<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises 3.0 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises 3.0 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Friday said it sold three million dinars of 26-week bills at its weekly auction on December 31, repaying 34.8 million dinars of maturing paper.</p>
<p>The 26-week bill was at a 7.8750 percent coupon rate.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 483 million dinars of 13-, 26-, 52-week and two-, three-, four-, five-year paper at between 7.8750 and 8.5 percent.</p>
<p>($=one dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
